### 2. Primary: `LoadDetail()` method (lines 827-880)

This method has two branches:

**Branch A — Loading from Input Voucher (Return)** — lines 829-853:
```18:18:g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL\-vat-tuquangbin\StockManager\Voucher\Output\frmOutputVoucherDetail.cs
